5. Bug Identification and Fixing

During testing, errors are recorded and classified.

Example
Bug Identified
      ↓
Record Bug
      ↓
Find Cause
      ↓
Fix Bug
      ↓
Retest
      ↓
Confirm Resolution

Common bugs may include:

Incorrect login validation
Database connection errors
Incorrect search results
Document-formatting problems
Broken resource links
UI display problems
6. Testing Results

After completing testing, the development team verifies that:

Core modules function correctly.
User input is properly validated.
Database operations work correctly.
AI responses are appropriately grounded and presented as general information.
Documents are generated correctly.
Official resources are accessible.
Security controls function as intended.
The interface is easy to use.
7. Final Validation

Before deployment, the complete application is tested as a single system.

Requirements
     ↓
Test Results
     ↓
Bug Fixes
     ↓
Retesting
     ↓
Final System Validation
     ↓
Ready for Demonstration
8. Conclusion

The Project Testing Phase ensures that Legalease is functional, secure, reliable, and user-friendly. Through unit, integration, functional, AI-response, database, security, usability, and performance testing, errors can be identified and corrected before the final demonstration and deployment.
